  "thag1.66:1.1": "6 anusāsi mahāvīro ",
  "thag1.66:1.2": "sabbadhammāna pāragū ",
  "thag1.66:1.3": "tassāhaṃ dhammaṃ sutvāna ",
  "thag1.66:1.4": "vihāsiṃ santike rato ",
  "thag1.66:1.5": "tisso vijjā anuppattā ",
  "thag1.66:1.6": "kataṃ buddhassa sāsananti. ",
  "thag1.66:1.7": "meghiyo thero. "
}
